{"id":6333,"date":"2021-04-14T08:04:21","date_gmt":"2021-04-14T07:04:21","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/?p=6333"},"modified":"2022-12-02T11:01:48","modified_gmt":"2022-12-02T10:01:48","slug":"land-un-sproch-les-cahiers-du-bilinguisme","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/land-un-sproch-les-cahiers-du-bilinguisme\/","title":{"rendered":"LAND un Sproch, les cahiers du bilinguisme"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>La revue bilingue LAND un Sproch, propose de nombreuse informations sur la situation linguistique de notre r\u00e9gion, sur l\u2019histoire, la litt\u00e9rature, la culture, etc.<\/p>\n<p><!--more--><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/LAND-un-Sproch_7423.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"wp-image-6334 size-medium alignleft\" src=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/LAND-un-Sproch_7423-230x300.jpg\" width=\"230\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/LAND-un-Sproch_7423-230x300.jpg 230w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/LAND-un-Sproch_7423-768x1000.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/LAND-un-Sproch_7423-786x1024.jpg 786w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/LAND-un-Sproch_7423-300x391.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/LAND-un-Sproch_7423-1008x1313.jpg 1008w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/LAND-un-Sproch_7423-1350x1758.jpg 1350w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/LAND-un-Sproch_7423-84x110.jpg 84w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/LAND-un-Sproch_7423-102x133.jpg 102w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 230px) 100vw, 230px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>Depuis 40 ans, la revue constitue une source inestimables d\u2019informations linguistiques et culturelles.<\/p>\n<p>Dans \u00ab\u00a0<a href=\"http:\/\/alsace2cultures.canalblog.com\/pages\/revue-land-un-sproch\/37593646.html\">notre local<\/a>\u00ab\u00a0, t\u00e9l\u00e9chargez\u00a0gratuitement d\u2019anciens num\u00e9ros de la revue.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>La loi \u00ab\u00a0Molac\u00a0\u00bb sur la protection et la promotion des langues r\u00e9gionales a \u00e9t\u00e9 adopt\u00e9 hier \u00e0 l&rsquo;Assembl\u00e9e nationale. Cette loi d\u00e9finit trois domaines d&rsquo;action : l&rsquo;enseignement, le patrimoine et les services publics (signal\u00e9tique et actes d\u2019\u00e9tat civil).<\/p>\n<p>La Collectivit\u00e9 europ\u00e9enne d&rsquo;Alsace, \u00e0 travers ses nouvelles comp\u00e9tences dans la promotion du bilinguisme, la langue et culture r\u00e9gionale mais \u00e9galement sa comp\u00e9tence li\u00e9e aux coll\u00e8ges et aux politiques \u00e9ducatives, a un r\u00f4le majeur \u00e0 jouer.<\/p>\n<p>La loi permettra deux nouveaut\u00e9s principales dont l&rsquo;instauration de l&rsquo;enseignement immersif \u00e9largie aux \u00e9tablissements publics. Il s\u2019agit<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0 <\/span>\u00ab\u00a0d\u2019assurer l\u2019acquisition d\u2019une seconde langue \u2013 celle-ci servant de support \u00e0 l\u2019enseignement d\u2019un certain nombre de mati\u00e8res \u2013 sans remettre en cause l\u2019acquisition et l\u2019enseignement de la langue fran\u00e7aise. Les langues utilis\u00e9es sont ainsi \u00ab\u00a0acquises\u00a0\u00bb et non simplement \u00ab\u00a0apprises\u00a0\u00bb, et se renforcent mutuellement\u201d.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>La revue bilingue LAND un Sproch, propose de nombreuse informations sur la situation linguistique de notre r\u00e9gion, sur l\u2019histoire, la litt\u00e9rature, la culture, etc.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":6,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_expiration-date-status":"","_expiration-date":0,"_expiration-date-type":"","_expiration-date-categories":[],"_expiration-date-options":[]},"categories":[39],"tags":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/6333"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/6"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=6333"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/6333\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":6336,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/6333\/revisions\/6336"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=6333"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=6333"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=6333"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}